			"date": "2026-05-15T19:17:58.305Z",
			"content": "<p>Websites are just downloading an app every time you want to use it;</p>\n<p>SaaS but worse</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:4hm2yozxzsakerfalloor5s6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mlzxs6g6ws2b",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/anatudor.bsky.social/post/3mlzxs6g6ws2b",
			"author": {
				"name": "Ana Tudor",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/anatudor.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:4hm2yozxzsakerfalloor5s6/bafkreicqw7fxgwhrsestevru7zj4yazlcdfhibmuc2kvnllcf4mwbykeca"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T08:43:22.415Z",
			"content": "<p>The thing that rich people in tech cannot get: owning a website is more expensive than coding... an app. Or anything for that matter.</p>\n<p>Sincerele, someone who could never afford to own a website and likely never will.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2lxbzbvs2o",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:4hm2yozxzsakerfalloor5s6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mlzxs6g6ws2b",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3mm2lxbzbvs2o",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T14:44:08.795Z",
			"content": "<p>How are you defining ownership? I think a domain name should be the only requirement for ownership (though some would classify it as renting)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:prgzygmztzve2tfwtxy4ne7l/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2m4tmi7k2s",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2lxbzbvs2o",
