				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/passle.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:kn5hbzh6ig6qla64l5puqapb/bafkreifipcqpwxxju76ctbctkawtj6rcuevxfbv5cjyehdw7jg6royxivi"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T15:02:58.694Z",
			"content": "<p>Comrade zach 🫡</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2ohtbl6s2d",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:wlv2lek2tmwsfpob3r4mix7y/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2m7moobc2p",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3mm2ohtbl6s2d",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T15:29:11.248Z",
			"content": "<p>I have a timeshare you might be interested in</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2ooxz2t22d",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:4hm2yozxzsakerfalloor5s6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2myg3bss24",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3mm2ooxz2t22d",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T15:33:11.092Z",
			"content": "<p>That’s fair. I think there is a spectrum of “ownership” — your <a href=\"https://github.io\">github.io</a> web site is *yours* (and hopefully doesn’t have a recurring cost to you). But certainly you have *more* ownership if you pay $10 a year for your domain name and build some domain name equity on it. $10/yr definitely adds up</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:pxrfizqx45aknvaeshcsevzx/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2p42d2f22n",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:4hm2yozxzsakerfalloor5s6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2myg3bss24",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jackhpeterson.com/post/3mm2p42d2f22n",
			"author": {
				"name": "Jack",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jackhpeterson.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:pxrfizqx45aknvaeshcsevzx/bafkreifcq35cj4mknrecbe3d7czz2niuilxnfwf6aftowaospye4pdokcu"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T15:40:29.723Z",
			"content": "<p>Last I knew it costs money to be a developer who can release to the app stores.</p>\n<p>- Apple charges $99 a year<br>\n- Google charges a one time $25 fee<br>\n(Might've changed)</p>\n<p>Netlify allows static site deployment to a Netlify subdomain for free.</p>\n<p>Some domains can be cheap. ~$3 per year.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:gilu7o4lu2uhhh2sztjeo47i/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2pegd7v22d",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mlvkrgogmk2h",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/g12n.de/post/3mm2pegd7v22d",
			"author": {
				"name": "Michael G",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/g12n.de",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:gilu7o4lu2uhhh2sztjeo47i/bafkreiduwoybgec263zc4ti4226xdjt25gw5ooorl34kh36rqg6lzhrytm"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T15:45:10.748Z",
			"content": "<p>😅 coding isn’t much of a problem. But if owning contains hosting it, this is astoundingly complex. <br>\nI should acctually simply be a feature of your internet router defaulting to your landlines or mobile phone number. A simple box like fax machine. Sadly the web went quite a different route.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:4o6o6re5hrzy4v5acedmufj4/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2repqa2s2n",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:4hm2yozxzsakerfalloor5s6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mlzxs6g6ws2b",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cthos.dev/post/3mm2repqa2s2n",
			"author": {
				"name": "Cthos",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cthos.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:4o6o6re5hrzy4v5acedmufj4/bafkreicm4q4nnexbtsyym466ur5g2merz74is6z7emgtf7yiyld7r3cg34"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T16:21:08.095Z",
			"content": "<p>But the thing Adam is responding to (that Zach is quote boosting) is the GenAI companies claiming everyone will just use an LLM to make an app. An LLM which requires a subscription to a GenAI company. Which is currently being subsidized by a factor of at least 10.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:4o6o6re5hrzy4v5acedmufj4/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2ris27jc2n",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:pxrfizqx45aknvaeshcsevzx/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2p42d2f22n",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cthos.dev/post/3mm2ris27jc2n",
			"author": {
				"name": "Cthos",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cthos.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:4o6o6re5hrzy4v5acedmufj4/bafkreicm4q4nnexbtsyym466ur5g2merz74is6z7emgtf7yiyld7r3cg34"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T16:23:24.737Z",
			"content": "<p>You can (for now) distribute Android apps for free, but Google is trying its darndest to stop that practice (by requiring every developer to register and create restrictions on side loading)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:zjbq26wybii5ojoypkso2mso/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2rqkx2jc2f",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:4hm2yozxzsakerfalloor5s6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mlzxs6g6ws2b",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jauntywunderkind.bsky.social/post/3mm2rqkx2jc2f",
			"author": {
				"name": "JauntyWunderKind",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jauntywunderkind.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:zjbq26wybii5ojoypkso2mso/bafkreigma5nlttj6wbqvoiobpvqhztjf34w4jyv2qv2vzmqfrv4pzzeedu"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T16:27:45.726Z",
			"content": "<p>Get yourself / your site AtHosted for free with <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:7puq73yz2hkvbcpdhnsze2qw\">@wisp.place</a>.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:4hm2yozxzsakerfalloor5s6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2ruxh7hs2q",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:pxrfizqx45aknvaeshcsevzx/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2p42d2f22n",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/anatudor.bsky.social/post/3mm2ruxh7hs2q",
			"author": {
				"name": "Ana Tudor",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/anatudor.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:4hm2yozxzsakerfalloor5s6/bafkreicqw7fxgwhrsestevru7zj4yazlcdfhibmuc2kvnllcf4mwbykeca"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T16:30:13.058Z",
			"content": "<p>As a Linux user who has never owned a smartphone, I think of something different when I see the word app...</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xei4kpuuaogvgnvufre7wvjm/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2skrbbxs2m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:pxrfizqx45aknvaeshcsevzx/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2p42d2f22n",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/alvaromontoro.com/post/3mm2skrbbxs2m",
			"author": {
				"name": "Álvaro Montoro",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/alvaromontoro.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xei4kpuuaogvgnvufre7wvjm/bafkreigphqyvgorv7zyiphugwgccquzbevo7hvxflrujfoy6qhee4o6goy"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T16:42:24.772Z",
			"content": "<p>The reason why I stopped publishing apps on iOS. You need to monetize or you are losing money. For an indie developer, it's not worth it. I only added ads to my apps to try to overcome that, and it only made things worse, so I ended up removing the apps from Apple Store.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:4o6o6re5hrzy4v5acedmufj4/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2sphl3zs2n",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xei4kpuuaogvgnvufre7wvjm/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2skrbbxs2m",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cthos.dev/post/3mm2sphl3zs2n",
			"author": {
				"name": "Cthos",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cthos.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:4o6o6re5hrzy4v5acedmufj4/bafkreicm4q4nnexbtsyym466ur5g2merz74is6z7emgtf7yiyld7r3cg34"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T16:45:02.380Z",
			"content": "<p>The reason I don't distribute through the Play store is because they immediately took the app down the first time I tried and then threatened to ban my google account with no review or appeal. So. *shrug*</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xei4kpuuaogvgnvufre7wvjm/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2subbmmc2m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2lxbzbvs2o",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/alvaromontoro.com/post/3mm2subbmmc2m",
			"author": {
				"name": "Álvaro Montoro",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/alvaromontoro.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xei4kpuuaogvgnvufre7wvjm/bafkreigphqyvgorv7zyiphugwgccquzbevo7hvxflrujfoy6qhee4o6goy"
			},
			"date": "2026-05-17T16:47:43.550Z",
			"content": "<p>+hosting.</p>\n<p>I've gone around it by publishing \"static sites\" using GitHub pages, but I wouldn't be able to put my PHP/SQL databases projects there. And hosting prices have skyrocketed (e.g. 8 years ago, I got a 10 year hosting for less than $200 total, nowadays with that money you get 12-18 months.)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xei4kpuuaogvgnvufre7wvjm/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2svvshps2m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:4o6o6re5hrzy4v5acedmufj4/app.bsky.feed.post/3mm2sphl3zs2n",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/alvaromontoro.com/post/3mm2svvshps2m",
			"author": {
